Recovery reasoning: The clean import and 2/6 CACHED summary make caching look healthy, but the only cached steps are the zero-cost FROM and WORKDIR before any COPY. BuildKit invalidates at the first changed instruction and everything after: with COPY . . ahead of RUN npm ci, any file change — even a README — busts the install layer. PR #412 likely reordered the COPY.
